      "parameters": {
        "width": 640,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "## AI Fronter: WhatsApp front desk\nOne workflow serves every business. The Evolution instance name in the webhook tells the database which business the message is for (channels.evolution_instance).\n\nCredentials to set: **Supabase Postgres** (session pooler, SSL on), **Gemini API key**, **Groq API key** (Header Auth: Authorization = Bearer ...), **Evolution API key** (Header Auth: apikey = ...).\n\nHuman takeover: set conversations.status = 'human' and the bot goes quiet for that chat (messages are still logged)."
      }
